questions.question:
A teammate registers this hook to stop duplicate refunds:

hooks = {"PostToolUse": [HookMatcher(matcher="process_refund", hooks=[block_if_duplicate])]}

Duplicate refunds still reach customers' cards, although block_if_duplicate correctly detects them. What is the root cause?

process_refund returns:
{"isError": true, "errorCategory": "policy_violation", "retryable": false, "message": "Order is outside the 90-day refund window"}
ShopAssist retries the identical call four times. What should the agent do instead?
